{"id":"608723650","kind":"article","title":"自制卡片的间隔可以排得更长","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Cards_created_by_oneself_can_be_scheduled_more_aggressively"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2023-02-23","updated":"2023-02-23","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":287,"keywords":["间隔重复","自制卡片","复习间隔","上下文","Anki"],"summary":"译文指出，若卡片由学习者从正在读的材料中自行制作，复习所需事实已有充分上下文，因此其间隔可比外语词汇卡片安排得更长；作者同时提示，卡片间隔还需结合牌组设置考虑。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/608723650","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"另见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"Mwr-vJc6\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Andy_Matuschak\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Andy Matuschak</a> 针对《量子国度》也发表过类似观点：如果你遇到的卡片，来自于你正在阅读的文章，那么你对卡片测试的事实有足够的了解，因此相比于外语词汇卡片，这张卡片的复习间隔可以拉得更长。你充分理解材料，并用材料制作卡片，这些卡片也同样适用。</p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">另见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"QDD_5umj\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Anki_deck_options\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anki 牌组设置</a> ——内有关于排期的更多思考</li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"SvcaV5Jr\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Anki_deck_options\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anki 牌组设置</a> (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Anki+deck+options\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← links</a>)</li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"ciMnci-N\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a>汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 Shom、校对 <span class=\"nolink\">Albert</span><br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Cards_created_by_oneself_can_be_scheduled_more_aggressively\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cards created by oneself can be scheduled more aggressively</a></blockquote>","rec_chain":[{"id":"605412651","title":"关于间隔收件箱的一些想法","author":"Issa Rice","votes":11,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"609076131","title":"为什么垃圾教材遍地走？关于解释的科学。","author":"Issa Rice","votes":338,"minutes":10,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}